1787155955000423	maw-dev/0	itc:v3:AWL_JPJM885kQAAAAAAAQf9Xq3vdoAAAAAEsJQ		item.comment	bn-mq3b	{"body":"Root-caused. FF-absorb (reconcile_epoch_with_branch/sync_ff_paths_in_worktree in workspace/merge.rs) advances a dirty sibling's HEAD to branch_oid even when the sibling is >1 epoch behind and has uncommitted edits in a path that changed in an EARLIER epoch (path is in the sibling's own HEAD..target diff but NOT in global ff_paths, so the dirty∩ff_paths predicate misses it). Worktree keeps the stale worker file; the next commit silently reverts the epoch's hunks. Reproduced deterministically (/tmp/repro-ff2.sh). Fix: gate dirty FastForward siblings on dirty∩own-stale; when non-empty, leave the sibling stale (no ref/HEAD move) + warn, mirroring auto-rebase SkippedDirty."}	blake3:Tnyq5GoYpOL1N1QZp1EebHNrrGJvHnHOzEjgoho3ZXU
1787156746675380	maw-dev/0	itc:v3:AWL_JPJM885kQAAAAAAAQf9Xq3vdoAAAAAEsJg		item.comment	bn-mq3b	{"body":"Self-review (risk:high, REVIEW=false). Failure-mode checklist: (1) Fail-CLOSED — ff_dirty_stale_conflict returns ALL dirty paths when HEAD/tree/oid unreadable, so a sibling never advances unproven. (2) Non-dirty siblings unaffected (stale_dirty computed only when dirty). (3) Empty overlap => normal FastForward path, no behavior change. (4) Skipped sibling left EXACTLY in place (no ref/HEAD/materialization move), protected by standard dirty guards; later 'maw ws sync' does real 3-way rebase. (5) Warning names sibling + up to 5 stale paths + exact recovery command. Verified: targeted test asserts HEAD never moves AND agent's next commit reverts no epoch hunks (end-to-end bn-2fto symptom absent). Full 'just check' green incl DST harness + contract_drift."}	blake3:eej0A_EnqE-fO0W5yGW-lNZQ2Vub0Hbet5waR4A5HOs
1787156776569316	maw-dev/0	itc:v3:AWL_JPJM885kQAAAAAAAQf9Xq3vdoAAAAAEsJw		item.move	bn-mq3b	{"reason":"Completed — FF-absorb no longer advances a dirty stale sibling; fix + regression test merged @ 4537c51e","state":"done"}	blake3:brlFlTBjFaxvkpm2jJ6E9Pu8DRJJSV_CImKyrW7JImA
