1787959775795248	maw-dev	itc:v3:AWKTmSTM_JOSSTQAAAAAQa7Vbfq6qsAAAAEykxc		item.create	bn-emj1	{"description":"Refresh detached root worktree after quarantine promotion\n\nFull detail: After \u001b[48;5;237m\u001b[38;5;252mmaw merge promote 881af3a6a92f\u001b[49m\u001b[39m, \u001b[48;5;237m\u001b[38;5;252mrefs/heads/main\u001b[49m\u001b[39m and the Maw epoch point to \u001b[48;5;237m\u001b[38;5;252m881af3a\u001b[49m\u001b[39m, but Sigil's default/root worktree remains detached at \u001b[48;5;237m\u001b[38;5;252md502222\u001b[49m\u001b[39m with managed \u001b[48;5;237m\u001b[38;5;252m.bones\u001b[49m\u001b[39m changes. \u001b[48;5;237m\u001b[38;5;252mmaw ws status\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \nreports it in sync, while \u001b[48;5;237m\u001b[38;5;252mmaw ws sync\u001b[49m\u001b[39m skips default. Determine the supported safe refresh command or fix this path without losing dirty state.","kind":"task","title":"Refresh detached root worktree after quarantine promotion"}	blake3:yqyIVlH1Rs6-X5-VTYfVJQwH58Ejd3xwD1mxrhIuRbk
1787960011549426	maw-dev/0	itc:v3:AWL_JPJM885kQAAAAAAAQf9Xq3vdoAAAAAEsKA		item.update	bn-emj1	{"field":"labels","value":{"action":"add","label":"risk:high"}}	blake3:w41zaYpy_hFFiDG-0RCHsxzyiC0mWVtvJqiQxOweeL4
1787960011586228	maw-dev/0	itc:v3:AWL_JPJM885kQAAAAAAAQf9Xq3vdoAAAAAEsKQ		item.comment	bn-emj1	{"body":"Root cause: promote_quarantine (src/merge/quarantine.rs:400-407) advances epoch + branch refs but never refreshes the default/root worktree. Normal 'maw ws merge' refreshes default via update_default_workspace (crates/maw-cli/src/workspace/merge.rs:6970), which snapshots dirty state, checks out the new epoch, and replays. After promote, default is left detached at epoch_before with dirty state; 'ws advance default' refuses ('updated automatically during merge') and 'ws sync' skips default. Fix: call update_default_workspace from promote() after a Committed result. Immediate manual recovery sent to sigil-dev: stash -u; switch main; stash pop."}	blake3:2owcuSpP3l9suKTjIkUZJwTjrAeJw2j8iYTReYve64Q
1787960011609587	maw-dev/0	itc:v3:AWL_JPJM885kQAAAAAAAQf9Xq3vdoAAAAAEsKg		item.move	bn-emj1	{"state":"doing"}	blake3:FHZ291w4dI0756P5lpt-Ki1jG17Mu4TpMCIK-9JbxlE
1787960011615287	maw-dev/0	itc:v3:AWL_JPJM885kQAAAAAAAQf9Xq3vdoAAAAAEsKw		item.assign	bn-emj1	{"action":"assign","agent":"maw-dev/0"}	blake3:PRdAgoBwj7_GGcMTasw3LGhKG4cas9OjDtIMuk1B9lI
1787960712279626	maw-dev/0	itc:v3:AWL_JPJM885kQAAAAAAAQf9Xq3vdoAAAAAEsLA		item.comment	bn-emj1	{"body":"Fix implemented in ws bn-emj1: promote() now calls refresh_default_after_promote() -> workspace::merge::update_default_workspace after a Committed result, mirroring the normal merge path (snapshot dirty -> checkout new epoch -> replay, with recovery ref pinning). Best-effort: on failure it warns with the manual stash/switch/pop recovery instead of failing the already-committed promote. New end-to-end regression test tests/promote_refreshes_default_bn_emj1.rs drives merge->quarantine->fix->promote and asserts default HEAD == new epoch AND a dirty default edit survives. Verified the test FAILS without the fix (default stuck at stale epoch) and passes with it. Running full just check before merge."}	blake3:3qqvkZ-G6gyUs2KdVFOJdRjGqey1yGcTdkygYmjAQaM
1787961365190496	maw-dev/0	itc:v3:AWL_JPJM885kQAAAAAAAQf9Xq3vdoAAAAAEsLQ		item.move	bn-emj1	{"reason":"Fixed: promote now refreshes default worktree via update_default_workspace; merged to main 4c445875","state":"done"}	blake3:8LkhPi2d1aho-LEeC7HNDDz5yH059VVR3Kjf4_WQqys
